'''Litten''' (Japanese: '''ニャビー''' ''Nyabby'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

