==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Litten|24}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Litten}}.
*'''Heat Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Arcanine|1}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

